---
title: "Figure 7.2.2 - Start Simulation Session"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SessionGW as Session Gateway
    participant SessionCtrl as Session Controller
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant ScenarioRepo as Scenario Repository
    participant PersonaRepo as Persona Repository
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (RabbitMQ)
    participant WebRTCSvc as WebRTC Service

    User->>SessionGW: POST /sessions<br/>{userId, orgId, mode, scenarioId?, personaId?}
    SessionGW->>SessionCtrl: Forward request
    SessionCtrl->>OrchSvc: Initialize session

    alt scenarioId provided
        OrchSvc->>ScenarioRepo: Retrieve scenario
        alt Scenario not found
            ScenarioRepo-->>OrchSvc: Not found
            OrchSvc-->>SessionCtrl: 404 Scenario Not Found
            SessionCtrl-->>User: 404 Error
        else Scenario found
            ScenarioRepo-->>OrchSvc: Scenario config
        end
    end

    alt personaId provided
        OrchSvc->>PersonaRepo: Retrieve persona
        alt Persona not found
            PersonaRepo-->>OrchSvc: Not found
            OrchSvc-->>SessionCtrl: 404 Persona Not Found
            SessionCtrl-->>User: 404 Error
        else Persona found
            PersonaRepo-->>OrchSvc: Persona traits
        end
    end

    Note over OrchSvc: Create user/org snapshot<br/>(name, email, team)
    OrchSvc->>SessionRepo: Create session<br/>{status: "active", context}
    SessionRepo-->>OrchSvc: Session created

    OrchSvc->>EventBus: Emit simulation.started<br/>{sessionId, metadata}

    alt mode is "voice" or "video"
        OrchSvc->>WebRTCSvc: Initialize call infrastructure
        WebRTCSvc-->>OrchSvc: Connection details
    end

    OrchSvc-->>SessionCtrl: Session data
    SessionCtrl-->>User: 201 Created<br/>{sessionId, context}

---
title: "Figure 7.2.3 - Advance Turn - Text Chat"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SessionGW as Session Gateway
    participant TurnCtrl as Turn Controller
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository
    participant GuardrailSvc as Guardrail Service
    participant RedactionRepo as RedactionSpan Repository
    participant ContextSvc as Context Service
    participant RetrievalSvc as Retrieval Service
    participant EmbeddingRepo as Embedding Repository
    participant PromptSvc as Prompt Service
    participant LLMSvc as LLM Service
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant MetricSvc as Metric Service
    participant MetricRepo as Metric Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>SessionGW: POST /sessions/{id}/turns<br/>{text}
    SessionGW->>TurnCtrl: Forward request

    TurnCtrl->>SessionRepo: Validate session exists
    alt Session not found or ended
        SessionRepo-->>TurnCtrl: Not found/ended
        TurnCtrl-->>User: 404/409 Error
    end
    SessionRepo-->>TurnCtrl: Session valid

    TurnCtrl->>OrchSvc: Process turn
    OrchSvc->>TurnRepo: Create Turn<br/>{role: "user", text, order}

    OrchSvc->>GuardrailSvc: Scan for PII
    GuardrailSvc->>GuardrailSvc: Detect PII spans
    alt PII detected
        GuardrailSvc->>RedactionRepo: Create RedactionSpan records
    end

    OrchSvc->>ContextSvc: Assemble conversation history
    ContextSvc->>TurnRepo: Retrieve previous turns
    TurnRepo-->>ContextSvc: Turn history
    ContextSvc-->>OrchSvc: Context assembled

    OrchSvc->>RetrievalSvc: Semantic search for context
    RetrievalSvc->>EmbeddingRepo: Vector similarity search (pgvector)
    EmbeddingRepo-->>RetrievalSvc: Relevant chunks
    RetrievalSvc-->>OrchSvc: Retrieved context

    OrchSvc->>PromptSvc: Build prompt
    Note over PromptSvc: System instructions<br/>+ history + context<br/>+ guardrails
    PromptSvc-->>OrchSvc: Full prompt

    OrchSvc->>LLMSvc: Call LLM API (GPT-4o, streaming)
    LLMSvc-->>TurnCtrl: Stream tokens (SSE)
    TurnCtrl-->>User: Stream response

    Note over OrchSvc: As tokens arrive
    OrchSvc->>TurnRepo: Create assistant Turn
    OrchSvc->>MessageRepo: Create Message record

    OrchSvc->>MetricSvc: Log metrics
    MetricSvc->>MetricRepo: Store token counts, latency, model

    OrchSvc->>EventBus: Emit turn.completed<br/>{turnId, sessionId, metrics}

    OrchSvc-->>TurnCtrl: Response complete
    TurnCtrl-->>User: 200 OK

---
title: "Figure 7.2.7 - End Simulation Session"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SessionGW as Session Gateway
    participant SessionCtrl as Session Controller
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant WebRTCSvc as WebRTC Service
    participant CallRepo as Call Repository
    participant RecordingSvc as Recording Service
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant RecordingRepo as Recording Repository
    participant MetricRepo as Metric Repository
    participant EventBus as Event Bus
    participant FeedbackSvc as Feedback Service

    User->>SessionGW: POST /sessions/{id}/end<br/>{reason?}
    SessionGW->>SessionCtrl: Forward request

    SessionCtrl->>SessionRepo: Validate session exists & active
    alt Not found or already ended
        SessionRepo-->>SessionCtrl: Error
        SessionCtrl-->>User: 404/409 Error
    end
    SessionRepo-->>SessionCtrl: Session valid

    SessionCtrl->>OrchSvc: End session
    OrchSvc->>SessionRepo: Update session<br/>{status: "ended", endedReason, endedAt}

    alt Call is active
        OrchSvc->>WebRTCSvc: End call
        WebRTCSvc->>CallRepo: Update CallSession<br/>{status: "ended"}

        alt Recording was active
            WebRTCSvc->>RecordingSvc: Stop recording
            RecordingSvc->>RecordingSvc: Finalize media file
            RecordingSvc->>StorageSvc: Upload to S3/MinIO
            StorageSvc-->>RecordingSvc: Storage key

            RecordingSvc->>MediaRepo: Create MediaAsset<br/>{storageKey, mimeType, size}
            RecordingSvc->>RecordingRepo: Update Recording<br/>{assetId, duration}
        end
    end

    OrchSvc->>MetricRepo: Calculate total tokens & duration
    MetricRepo-->>OrchSvc: Usage summary

    OrchSvc->>EventBus: Emit simulation.completed<br/>{sessionId, reason, duration, metrics}

    alt Auto-feedback enabled
        EventBus-->>FeedbackSvc: Trigger scorecard generation (async)
    end

    OrchSvc-->>SessionCtrl: Session summary
    SessionCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{turns, duration, tokens}
